{% comment %}
  Brand typeface: TT Commons Pro, self-hosted from theme assets.

  Three files are licensed and shipped:
    500 Medium    body copy and headings
    600 DemiBold  card titles, wordmark
    700 Bold      emphasis

  The Figma uses Regular (400) in a few places. That file is not supplied,
  so the browser resolves 400 to the Medium file. To add it later, drop the
  woff2 into assets/ and add a matching @font-face block here.

  Must be rendered inside a {% style %} or <style> block.
{% endcomment %}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'TT Commons Pro';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url('{{ 'tt-commons-pro-medium.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'TT Commons Pro';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url('{{ 'tt-commons-pro-demibold.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'TT Commons Pro';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url('{{ 'tt-commons-pro-bold.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
}
